"A version of the 6x6 bimatrix game with 75 equilibria of :cite:p:`vS97` and :cite:p:`vS99`,
with much smaller payoffs than the original, which is also in this folder of the catalog.
75 equilibria is more than the previously conjectured bound of :math:`2^6 - 1 = 63`."

